WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:07.242
The Pentacles court cards show four practical temperaments,
from the learning Page to the experienced King.

00:00:07.242 --> 00:00:09.896
They can be people, parts of you or
approaches.

00:00:11.196 --> 00:00:12.265
Page of Pentacles.

00:00:12.265 --> 00:00:15.295
Study, curiosity about the practical, a
first step.

00:00:15.295 --> 00:00:19.869
The Page stands in a green field, gazing
at a single pentacle held carefully.

00:00:21.169 --> 00:00:22.438
Knight of Pentacles.

00:00:22.438 --> 00:00:24.914
Reliability, patience, steady progress.

00:00:24.914 --> 00:00:30.689
The Knight is usually shown on a still horse,
holding a pentacle and looking at it closely.

00:00:32.089 --> 00:00:34.463
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:34.463 --> 00:00:39.276
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
